    {
      "stem": "resources-mineral-uranium-mine-production-2024",
      "title": "Uranium mine production / 2024",
      "period_and_units": "2024 / metric tonnes uranium metal content",
      "interpretation": "BGS 2024 country series, printed page 75. Preserve estimated-country flags. Germany is an explicitly reported zero. Not U3O8-equivalent mass, enrichment, reserves, or nuclear power capacity. BGS and WNA totals differ; this plate uses BGS consistently. The 16 listed country rows sum to 59,725 tU (95.56% of the 62,500 tU printed world total); 2,775 tU remain unallocated. Russia has no row in this BGS table and remains missing; the residual is not assigned to it. Coverage denominator: Rounded BGS global mine production; excludes decommissioning operations.",
